# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ibibondo — frontend environment
#
# SAFE IN THE BROWSER. Anything with a VITE_ prefix is compiled into the
# JavaScript bundle and is readable by anyone who visits the site. Only put
# public identifiers here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Supabase — the anon key is designed to be public and is protected by
# row-level security policies on the database.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Cloudinary — the cloud name appears in every image URL, so it is public.
# The upload preset must be an UNSIGNED preset (Cloudinary dashboard → Settings
# → Upload → Upload presets → Signing Mode: Unsigned) — that's what lets the
# admin dashboard upload images straight from the browser with no backend.
VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
VITE_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER PUT THESE HERE
#
# Resend API key, Pesapal consumer key/secret, InTouch credentials and the
# Supabase service_role key are all SECRETS. Putting any of them in a VITE_
# variable publishes them to every visitor.
#
# They belong in Supabase Edge Function secrets. The frontend calls the Edge
# Function; the Edge Function talks to the provider.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
